{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仙附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉前後頒賜藏經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祀彌陀、地藏、伽藍、祖師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在普陀寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在潮音洞，今廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在潮音洞上，嘉靖間魯府建，今廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗名「十方堂」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大學士沈一貫題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗名「安樂\n堂」。以上諸堂俱在普陀寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊在普陀寺，今廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在普陀寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在普陀寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在本寺景命殿，左右各三十間。左為常住公用之所，右作\n僧寮，世世同居共食，立為規約，並不得分割房戶。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "計二十間。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋嘉定間建，今廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在育恩院內，都督楊宗業捐資剏建。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上三亭俱在本寺，總兵侯繼\n高建，今廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在烟霞館左，四圍松竹騰茂。萬曆三十年督造張隨\n\n建。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺左，督撫尹應元建，督造張隨題「海山\n天柱」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在無梁殿左。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在潮\n音洞，寧紹叅將董永燧立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本寺僧心一建。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在普陀寺前，高九丈六尺，皆太湖石，雕刻精巧。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在金剛窟，郡人尚寶司丞沈泰鴻建，延僧性汾守庵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡二座，一\n在千步沙，一在龍灣，為逝僧藏骨之所。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在西資庵右。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在蓮花洋畔，汛兵守此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在司基灣西。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在菩薩泉下，萬曆三十三年督造張隨建立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在短姑道頭左。於萬曆五年，寺僧明安建為登舟憇足之所。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在普陀寺前，古禪堂衕傍有泉，久旱不涸。萬曆三十五年三月，內\n欽差御馬監太監党禮奉㫖賫帑立碑，謝土啟建，圓滿道塲。同\n欽差御用監太監張隨率諸禪侶，赴潭請水，目覩有感，捐資鼎建。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在潮音洞上，宋紹興間，僧徳韶建，今廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在山\n門御道前，三十四年督造張隨建。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在鎮海寺前，剡人周汝登題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在普陀寺東約五里許。一山矗峙，曰光熈\n峯。有麻城僧真融，自五臺、伏牛、峩嵋、鎣華，咸剏飯僧之所。至萬曆八年，復來普\n\n陀，結茆數楹于峯下，漸建圓通等殿，然尚以「海潮庵」名。迄二十二年，郡守吳安\n國改額曰「海潮寺」。真融歿，其徒如壽等又為增建殿宇，規制弘麗。三十四年，御\n馬監太監党禮請於朝，賜今額。郡人大方伯馮叔吉、禮部主事屠隆記。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在鎮海寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉南北藏經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在龍池上，郡司\n理陽羨何士晉題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱在鎮海寺內。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在鎮海寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各三十間，作十方公用之所。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在淨業堂左。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在方丈後，會稽陶望\n齡題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺東首，安供以鎮山門。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺內。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在鎮海寺西山之麓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在鎮海寺西，即邉公窣堵波院也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每朶銀柄重十五兩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仙附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春至開花，獨先他處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長一尺，葉有毛，自三月食至五\n月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生海巖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形似得名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "種來日本，味甚\n甘羙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從郡東育王寺分植"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春月遍開，甚香，山之得名「小白華」以此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦遍開，清\n香異常，移種外方輙少開者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𣗳高數丈，丹葩滿枝，如珊瑚林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上下和鳴，如呼佛號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "低飛亂鳴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偶現不常"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二月十九日聚鳴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聚即香客至，又就手接食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上皆督造張隨畜放生\n池"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遍蓮花池皆是，其毛不及蘄州茸細。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大如斗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上遍山皆是，\n並不傷人。"}
